vlc-bin provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-libvlc CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::libvlc::libvlc)

unofficial::libvlc::libvlc pulls in libvlccore and the <vlc/vlc.h> include root.
The bundle is release-only, so every configuration takes the same binary.

find_package also sets VLC_PLUGINS_DIR to the codec plugin directory, which is
loaded at runtime and has to be staged beside the executable.
